<p><m>\ell</m> is parallel to the vector <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>\ell</m> may be parametrized by <m>tv+P</m> where 
<m>v</m>=<fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/> and <m>P</m> = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p>Thus <m>\ell</m> satisfies the parametric equation 
<CENTER/></p>
